</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/854a3362-7145-11f1-b3ef-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-26T000027Z-1989563951-RC2B1MAS9V8C-RTRMADP-3-NORTHKOREA-MISSILES.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/854a3362-7145-11f1-b3ef-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-26T000027Z-1989563951-RC2B1MAS9V8C-RTRMADP-3-NORTHKOREA-MISSILES.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">817d8232-97b7-11f1-80e3-e96c5995300c</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 08:09:42 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/854a3362-7145-11f1-b3ef-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-26T000027Z-1989563951-RC2B1MAS9V8C-RTRMADP-3-NORTHKOREA-MISSILES.jpg">via REUTERS - KCNA</source><dc:creator>林兰</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>百余名菲律宾公民在华被处理 菲防长批勒索敲诈 菲外交部促保障被捕国人福祉</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260813-%E7%99%BE%E4%BD%99%E5%90%8D%E8%8F%B2%E5%BE%8B%E5%AE%BE%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%8E%E8%A2%AB%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86-%E8%8F%B2%E9%98%B2%E9%95%BF%E6%89%B9%E5%8B%92%E7%B4%A2%E6%95%B2%E8%AF%88-%E8%8F%B2%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E9%83%A8%E4%BF%83%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E7%A6%8F%E7%A5%89</link><description>
